 PROVE SharedImmutable'
<2> HIDE DEF SFollow, CoreTypeOK, STypeOK
<2>old. SharedImmutable
 BY ONLY <1>UoOnqFdN5hlmOkH5yaHH03rU, V22_T_SharedImmutable, SMTT(5) DEF V22_T_SharedImmutable
